WEBVTT

00:03.120 --> 00:03.920
Two people

00:04.000 --> 00:04.520
Move this inside

00:04.600 --> 00:05.400
Carefully

00:05.480 --> 00:06.880
Please come in

00:07.440 --> 00:08.840
Hurry

00:13.440 --> 00:15.107
Though the material is ordinary

00:15.360 --> 00:16.760
These improved stirrups

00:17.240 --> 00:18.640
Are quite rare

00:20.760 --> 00:22.427
Why did we stop here?

00:25.480 --> 00:26.800
General Zu rarely returns

00:26.880 --> 00:28.280
Let's hurry

00:30.120 --> 00:31.120
Blocked ahead

00:31.200 --> 00:32.120
I'll clear a path

00:32.240 --> 00:33.360
No need

00:33.440 --> 00:34.840
Let's walk

00:37.360 --> 00:38.520
Prince of Ning

00:38.600 --> 00:39.360
General Zu

00:39.440 --> 00:40.840
Please come in

00:42.120 --> 00:43.400
Prince of Ning's meaning

00:43.480 --> 00:44.600
I understand

00:44.680 --> 00:45.720
If the general has difficulties

00:45.840 --> 00:47.507
In the capital or elsewhere

00:47.600 --> 00:49.360
You can directly send someone to inform me

00:49.440 --> 00:51.773
I will do my utmost to help

00:51.960 --> 00:52.600
Thank you

00:52.680 --> 00:54.200
What a grand gesture

00:54.840 --> 00:56.240
Move faster

00:56.480 --> 00:58.813
Don't block others from coming and going

01:00.080 --> 01:01.240
Second brother is here too

01:01.360 --> 01:03.027
Greetings to Prince of Jin

01:03.600 --> 01:05.000
General Zu

01:05.080 --> 01:06.480
Elder brother

01:06.960 --> 01:07.600
Why

01:07.680 --> 01:09.347
Did you walk here yourself?

01:11.080 --> 01:12.747
I blocked the way ahead

01:12.840 --> 01:14.400
If you need to move things

01:14.480 --> 01:16.813
I'll have them help you move them

01:19.840 --> 01:21.240
This box

01:21.480 --> 01:23.480
Is the gift you prepared, right?
